# --- Paper bot secrets (Telegram alerts only) ---
#
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. Copy this file to ".env"  (just the name .env, no .example)
#   2. Fill in the two values below
#   3. Run the bot normally — it loads .env automatically
#
# The real ".env" is gitignored, so your token never gets committed.
# Both values are OPTIONAL: leave them blank to skip Telegram (alerts then
# just go to the log file) — the bot runs the same either way.

# From @BotFather on Telegram: /newbot -> it gives you this token.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=

# Message your new bot once, then open:
#   https://api.telegram.org/bot<YOUR_TOKEN>/getUpdates
# and copy the "chat":{"id": ... } number.
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
